1
00:00:00,801 --> 00:00:02,801
(Bernadette:)Excuse me, I need to have a chat
with my husband.

2
00:00:02,870 --> 00:00:04,980
Well, now, keep it short.

3
00:00:05,039 --> 00:00:07,919
(Sheldon:)From what I gather,
brevity is your friend.

4
00:00:09,577 --> 00:00:11,247
(Sheldon:)So, are we good here?

5
00:00:11,345 --> 00:00:14,515
(Amy:)No, we're not good here.
I am working on this project.

6
00:00:14,548 --> 00:00:16,718
Yeah, you can't tell her
what she can and cannot do.

7
00:00:16,817 --> 00:00:18,527
(Sheldon:)Last week, you told Leonard
he couldn't wear

8
00:00:18,586 --> 00:00:20,426
(Sheldon:)his Wookie jacket out in public.

9
00:00:21,856 --> 00:00:23,496
(Penny:)That's different.
I'm not going to the mall

10
00:00:23,557 --> 00:00:26,227
(Penny:)with someone dressed
like a dumb space bear.

11
00:00:28,262 --> 00:00:29,742
(Amy:)Sheldon, you don't have to worry
about me bothering you.

12
00:00:29,897 --> 00:00:31,237
(Amy:)I'll be in a different building,

13
00:00:31,398 --> 00:00:33,398
(Amy:)and we don't even have
to have lunch together.

14
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:34,880
(Sheldon:)-Really?
-Yes.

15
00:00:35,035 --> 00:00:37,105
(Amy:)Before all things, I'm a scientist.

16
00:00:37,204 --> 00:00:39,084
(Amy:)I'm just there to do my work
and, with a little luck,

17
00:00:39,240 --> 00:00:42,280
(Amy:)scare the living crap
out of some monkeys.

18
00:00:43,277 --> 00:00:44,777
(Sheldon:)Hmm.

19
00:00:46,280 --> 00:00:48,730
(Sheldon:)You sure your moth-like personality
won't be drawn

20
00:00:48,782 --> 00:00:51,062
(Sheldon:)to this blazing fire that is myself?

21
00:00:54,588 --> 00:00:57,018
(Amy:)More and more sure.

